  check `X ~> probe.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `X ~> takes_u8.Param(0)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `probe.CommonResult <= probe(x)`: Ok(Identity)
  check `takes_u8.Result <= takes_u8(x)`: Ok(Identity)
